# Title: Suspicious Debugger Registration Cmdline
# ID: ae215552-081e-44c7-805f-be16f975c8a2
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), oscd.community, Jonhnathan Ribeiro
# Date: 2019-09-06
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1546.008
# Description: Detects the registration of a debugger for a program that is available in the logon screen (sticky key backdoor).
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine:*\\CurrentVersion\\Image File Execution Options\\*) AND ((CommandLine:*sethc.exe* OR CommandLine:*utilman.exe* OR CommandLine:*osk.exe* OR CommandLine:*magnify.exe* OR CommandLine:*narrator.exe* OR CommandLine:*displayswitch.exe* OR CommandLine:*atbroker.exe* OR CommandLine:*HelpPane.exe*)))
